en:
‘Oh, but not here!’ said Mrs. Kenwigs. ‘We are all so very friendly and
pleasant, that you might as [[Well|well]] be going through it in your own room;
besides, the occasion--’

‘Compose yourself, my own angel,’ said Madame. ‘It was nobody’s fault;
it was mine as much as yours, we shall do very [[Well|well]] yet. Come, Alfred,
come.’

it:
«Componetevi, mio angelo», disse la Madame. «Non è stata colpa di nessuno;
è stata colpa mia tanto quanto vostra, ce la faremo benissimo. Vieni, Alfred,
vieni.»
